你做的菩萨怎么会是真人呢? How can a Bodhisattva made by you be a real person?

10
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:58,060
等你娶了功名啊,天下美女多得是 When you get married, there are so many beautiful women in the world.

11
00:01:58,580 --> 00:02:00,320
何必做白日梦呢? Why do you have to have a daydream?

12
00:02:01,380 --> 00:02:03,680
雨夜已停啊,我们还是上路吧 The rain has stopped, let's get on the road.

13
00:02:15,190 --> 00:02:17,390
徐贵,把毛笔拿给我 Xu Gui, give me the毛笔.

14
00:02:17,770 --> 00:02:18,530
是 Yes

15
00:02:39,320 --> 00:02:44,520
榴莲徘徊,金黄辉,谁能洗我此时心? The durian is wandering, the gold is falling. Who can wash my heart?

16
