就让我们借住一宿嘛 Just let us stay here for one night.

34
00:05:11,770 --> 00:05:13,030
借住一宿? Stay here for one night?

35
00:05:15,730 --> 00:05:16,710
小意思 It's a small thing.

36
00:05:17,890 --> 00:05:21,450
白天可以,晚上不行 It's fine during the day, but not at night.

37
00:05:22,530 --> 00:05:24,290
为什么不行啊 Why not?

38
00:05:25,930 --> 00:05:29,990
我家有个美娇女,从来没见过男人 I have a beautiful girl, but never seen a man.

39
00:05:31,450 --> 00:05:33,590
算了吧,就凭我啊 Forget it, I'm the only one.

40
