58
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:24,700
你无故闯进娇女的闺房,动手动脚,还有礼呀 You broke into Jiao Nui's room for no reason, and now you're doing it.

59
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:27,220
刚才说的话现在就忘了 You forgot what you said just now.

60
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:29,960
像你这种蛮口仁义道德的伪君子, Like you, a man of good morals,

61
