老大爷,我,我给您跪一下 Sir, please kneel down.

72
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:21,100
嗯,好了,这次饶了你,起来 Okay, I forgive you this time. Get up.

73
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:30,880
咱们是来跟人家借宿的,不是在家,也不是住客栈 We're here to rent a room, not at home, not in a hotel.

74
00:09:31,380 --> 00:09:35,720
要是不规矩,给人家赶出去啊,连歇都没地方歇 If we don't follow the rules, we'll be kicked out. There's no place to rest.

75
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:38,100
你在跟谁讲话 Who are you talking to?

76
00:09:39,820 --> 00:09:41,060
跟我自己讲 I'm talking to myself.

77
