仙女庙的事情,你忘了啊,公子 You forgot about the fairy temple, sir.

81
00:09:54,880 --> 00:10:01,200
那是仙女,我跟她开玩笑,现在是真人,我就是心里想,也不敢 That was a fairy, I was joking with her, now she's a real person, I just don't dare to think about it.

82
