好小子 Good boy.

95
00:11:45,010 --> 00:11:47,050
老大爷,这不是我的本意啊 Boss, this is not my intention.

96
00:11:48,210 --> 00:11:51,710
不是你本意?难道说还是我女儿送上门来不成 It's not your intention? Do you think it's my daughter who sent you here?

97
00:11:52,990 --> 00:11:55,550
不是啦,是我的公子拉我来的啦 No, it's my master who brought me here.

98
00:11:56,650 --> 00:12:03,130
我好心没好报,你晚上连找我女儿两次 I'm not good for you. You come to me twice a night.

99
