今天,我非把你带到衙门去不可 Today, I have to take you to the government office.

102
00:12:13,070 --> 00:12:17,530
大事化小,小事化无,送什么衙门,妈妈乎乎算了啦 It's not a big deal, it's not a big deal, it's not a big deal.

103
00:12:17,530 --> 00:12:20,050
送什么衙门,妈妈乎乎算了啦 It's not a big deal, it's not a big deal.

104
00:12:21,170 --> 00:12:23,490
什么妈妈乎乎算了,男女授受不亲 It's not a big deal, it's not a big deal.

105
