男女授受不亲,我要到衙门去告他,强奸为谁 I'm going to go to the government office to sue him, I'm going to make him pay.

106
00:12:27,770 --> 00:12:38,710
大人不计小人过 Boss, please forgive me.

107
00:12:38,710 --> 00:12:45,810
什么,我还没死你就咒我死,是不是想当我死了,还管我女儿走啊,走 What, you're cursing me to die before I die, do you want to take my daughter away when I'm dead? Go.

108
