No matter how ordinary you are, I only love you.

146
00:19:05,300 --> 00:19:08,820
Oh my god, what should I say?

147
00:19:09,320 --> 00:19:10,540
Don't say anything.

148
00:19:11,540 --> 00:19:20,440
When I get married, I'll come back to pick you up.

149
00:19:20,480 --> 00:19:23,140
At that time, we were in love.

150
00:19:23,660 --> 00:19:24,480
We loved each other.

151
