168
00:21:16,250 --> 00:21:18,310
They're just in love.

169
00:21:18,850 --> 00:21:20,170
It won't last long.

170
00:21:21,050 --> 00:21:22,050
We're in love.

171
00:21:22,150 --> 00:21:23,450
They're just in love.

172
00:21:23,450 --> 00:21:25,290
They're just in love.

173
00:21:35,770 --> 00:21:48,770
I don't want to go to the exam anymore.

174
00:21:48,770 --> 00:21:50,850
I want to be with my wife forever.

175
00:21:52,150 --> 00:21:53,050
That won't do.

176
00:21:53,610 --> 00:21:55,110
Aren't you the one who made me suffer?

177
