187
00:22:33,380 --> 00:22:34,960
If I can stay,

188
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:38,140
I'll stay here forever.

189
00:22:39,820 --> 00:22:41,760
Then let's not leave.

190
00:22:45,460 --> 00:22:46,740
Wife.

191
00:22:48,120 --> 00:22:49,920
Your future is important.

192
00:22:50,060 --> 00:22:52,740
I should encourage you to go to the exam.

193
00:22:52,740 --> 00:22:55,740
